\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Architecture of the inclusive mobile messaging system. The presentation layer~(React~Native), business layer (Spring~Boot REST~API and Django AI~API with RabbitMQ), persistence layer~(PostgreSQL), and multimodal conversion modules (TTS, STT, image-to-text, image-to-audio, video captioning) with end-to-end AES encryption are shown.}}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:arquitectura}{{1}{6}{}{figure.1}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Secure and accessible communication flow: asymmetric-key encryption and AI-based message adaptation according to the receiver's sensory profile. The message is encrypted at the source, decrypted on the server for accessible conversion, and re-encrypted before final delivery.}}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:flujo}{{2}{6}{}{figure.2}{}}
